{"ID":"20240205165623-k7rz4ma","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205165623-k7rz4ma","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205165623-k7rz4ma\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206110115-pgxa2am\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611150942-8mjwvw2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1583,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611151429-v6u1dkd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:9,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:9\u0026#125;","title":"174淫羊藿（三枝九叶草）","type":"doc","updated":"20240814184449"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206110115-pgxa2am","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206110115-pgxa2am","updated":"20240206110123"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产安徽、湖北、陕西、浙江等地。\n【性状】\t淫羊藿：茎细圆柱形，长约20cm，表面黄绿色或淡黄色，具光泽。茎生叶对生，二回三出复叶；小叶片卵圆形，长38cm，宽26cm；先端微尖，顶生小叶基部心形，两侧小叶较小，偏心形，外侧较大，呈耳状，边缘具黄色刺毛状细锯齿；上表面黄绿色，下表面灰绿色，主脉79条，基部有稀疏细长毛，细脉两面突起，网脉明显；小叶柄长15cm。叶片近革质。无臭，味微苦。\n箭叶淫羊藿：一回三出复叶，小叶片长卵形至卵状披针形，长412cm，宽2.55cm；先端浙尖，两侧小叶基部明显偏斜，外侧呈箭形。下表面疏被粗短伏毛或近无毛。叶片革质。\n柔毛淫羊藿：叶下表面及叶柄密被绒毛状柔毛。\n巫山淫羊藿：小叶片披针形至狭披针形，长923cm，宽1.84.5cm；先端渐尖或长渐尖，边缘具刺齿，侧生小叶基部的裂片偏斜，内边裂片小，圆形，外边裂片大，三角形，渐尖。下表面被绵毛或秃净。\n朝鲜淫羊藿：小叶较大，长410cm，宽3.57cm，先端长尖。叶片较薄。\n【性味】\t辛、甘，温。\n【功效】\t补肾阳，强筋骨，祛风湿。"}]},{"ID":"20240206110115-mjsbo4j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206110115-mjsbo4j","updated":"20240206110115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206110115-1lhylcx.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205170143-iuvumwa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205170143-iuvumwa","updated":"20240205170143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"淫羊藿"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/淫羊藿-20240205170143-32xs35w.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240624170316-y97z534","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624170316-y97z534","updated":"20240624171034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 350px;","style":"width: 340px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240624170757-4hq1pag.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 340px;\" parent-style=\"width: 350px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 325px;","style":"width: 315px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240624170316-g9fh93o.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 315px;\" parent-style=\"width: 325px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 384px;","style":"width: 374px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240624171034-za1dt8c.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 374px;\" parent-style=\"width: 384px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240624171735-brwg5i9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624171735-brwg5i9","updated":"20240814182137"},"Childre